        ],
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/extras/9f9300a76f4713d3fe230797d15eb34a.avif?t=1787022823\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Time Game is a complex strategy card-game where you can bend the rules of time to outsmart your opponents!  Play solo or online with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love Magic: The Gathering, or complex card games with card stacking mechanics, this is for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards each turn, trying to survive deadly weapons and bombs. Cards stack up; creating a complex chain of events, requiring you to predict future outcomes. Certain spaces on the board can give advantages while others will send you on an impromptu space-walk. Time is bent and logical strategy is created in the moment depending on the game state. The depth is seen in the course of rounds you survive in, resulting in a fight over abundant parts of the map while avoiding dangerous locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer, 2-4 Players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult ai bots to fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Board that changes each game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out how the future will unfold by creating rifts in time and deploying time bombs as future explosives. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize futuristic technology such as time machines, rocketships, as well as cryogenic chambers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Busted cards from spaces in time, use them to tilt the scales in your favour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/extras/9f9300a76f4713d3fe230797d15eb34a.avif?t=1787022823\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Time Game is a complex strategy card-game where you can bend the rules of time to outsmart your opponents!  Play solo or online with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love Magic: The Gathering, or complex card games with card stacking mechanics, this is for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards each turn, trying to survive deadly weapons and bombs. Cards stack up; creating a complex chain of events, requiring you to predict future outcomes. Certain spaces on the board can give advantages while others will send you on an impromptu space-walk. Time is bent and logical strategy is created in the moment depending on the game state. The depth is seen in the course of rounds you survive in, resulting in a fight over abundant parts of the map while avoiding dangerous locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer, 2-4 Players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult ai bots to fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Board that changes each game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out how the future will unfold by creating rifts in time and deploying time bombs as future explosives. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize futuristic technology such as time machines, rocketships, as well as cryogenic chambers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Busted cards from spaces in time, use them to tilt the scales in your favour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "The Time Game is a complex strategy card-game where you can twist the rules of time to outsmart your opponents. Play solo or online with friends. It uses a stack that players play on or pass. If everyone passes, all of the effects happen and the agents move forward in time.",
        "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal",
